<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Quản lý Sách Cloud - Nguyễn Hoàng Lực 23IT151</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: #f4f7f6; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; }
    header { background: #1b365d; color: white; padding: 22px 20px; text-align: center; border-bottom: 4px solid #0056b3; }
    header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: 700; }
    header p { font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.9; }
    
    .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 20px; flex: 1; width: 100%; }
    
    /* Session Status Bar (Tinh gon Option B) */
    .session-bar { background-color: #e9ecef; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 0.88rem; color: #495057; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
    .session-bar code { background-color: white; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #ced4da; font-family: monospace; color: #0d47a1; }

    .alert { padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-weight: 500; }
    .alert-error { background-color: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; }
    .alert-success { background-color: #d4edda; color: #155724; border: 1px solid #c3e6cb; }

    /* Layout 2 cot: Trai = Danh sach sach, Phai = Panel Them Sach */
    .main-layout { display: flex; gap: 25px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .left-column { flex: 2; min-width: 0; }
    .right-column { flex: 1; min-width: 320px; position: sticky; top: 20px; }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .main-layout { flex-direction: column-reverse; }
      .right-column { width: 100%; min-width: 100%; position: static; }
    }

    .card { background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 22px; margin-bottom: 25px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
    .card h2 { color: #1b365d; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.2rem; border-bottom: 2px solid #eef2f5; padding-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 600; }

    .form-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .form-group label { font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 5px; color: #495057; }
    .form-group input { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ced4da; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 0.95rem; width: 100%; }
    .form-group input:focus { outline: none; border-color: #0056b3; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(0,86,179,0.15); }
    .form-help { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #d9534f; margin-top: 4px; font-weight: 600; }

    .btn { background-color: #0056b3; color: white; border: none; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 600; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; transition: background 0.2s; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; }
    .btn:hover { background-color: #003d80; }

    /* Action Buttons */
    .btn-sm { padding: 5px 10px; font-size: 0.8rem; border-radius: 4px; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; margin-right: 4px; }
    .btn-edit { background-color: #ffc107; color: #212529; }
    .btn-edit:hover { background-color: #e0a800; }
    .btn-delete { background-color: #dc3545; color: white; }
    .btn-delete:hover { background-color: #c82333; }
    .btn-secondary { background-color: #6c757d; color: white; }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background-color: #5a6268; }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; }
    th, td { padding: 10px 10px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #eef2f5; vertical-align: middle; }
    th { background-color: #f8f9fa; color: #1b365d; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    tr:hover { background-color: #f8f9fa; }

    .book-cover { width: 45px; height: 60px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #eee; }
    .no-image { width: 45px; height: 60px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px dashed #ccc; background-color: #f9f9f9; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.65rem; color: #888; text-align: center; }

    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; background-color: #e9ecef; color: #495057; }
    .badge-code { background-color: #e3f2fd; color: #0d47a1; font-family: monospace; }
    .badge-vat { background-color: #e8f5e9; color: #1b5e20; }

    /* Modal Styling */
    .modal-overlay { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); justify-content: center; align-items: center; z-index: 1000; }
    .modal-content { background: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 500px; width: 90%; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    .modal-header { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1b365d; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px; }
    .modal-footer { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px; }

    footer { background-color: #1b365d; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 18px 20px; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-top: auto; border-top: 3px solid #0056b3; }
    footer p { margin: 3px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>ỨNG DỤNG QUẢN LÝ SÁCH CLOUD MONGODB ATLAS</h1>
    <p>Kiến trúc Đa luồng Phân quyền (Least Privilege) & Stateless Session - Nguyễn Hoàng Lực (23IT151)</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- Session Status Bar (Tinh gon Option B) -->
    <div class="session-bar">
      <span><strong>Stateless Session (Cloud Storage):</strong> Collection <code>sessions</code> @ MongoDB Atlas (User: <code>readwrite_23IT151</code>)</span>
      <span>Session ID: <code>{{sessionId}}</code> | <strong>Lượt xem:</strong> <span class="badge badge-code">{{viewsCount}} lượt</span></span>
    </div>

    {{#if error}}
      <div class="alert alert-error">
        THÔNG BÁO LỖI: {{error}}
      </div>
    {{/if}}

    {{#if success}}
      <div class="alert alert-success">
        THÀNH CÔNG: {{success}}
      </div>
    {{/if}}

    <div class="main-layout">
      
      <!-- CỘT BÊN TRÁI: DANH SÁCH SÁCH -->
      <div class="left-column">
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Danh Sách Sách Trong CSDL Cloud (Kết nối Read-Only User: read_23IT151)</h2>
          {{#if books.length}}
            <table>
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Ảnh</th>
                  <th>Mã Sách</th>
                  <th>Tên Sách</th>
                  <th>Tác Giả</th>
                  <th>Giá Gốc</th>
                  <th>VAT (5%)</th>
                  <th>Giá Sau Thuế</th>
                  <th>Hành Động (Write User)</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                {{#each books}}
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      {{#if this.imageUrl}}
                        <img src="{{this.imageUrl}}" alt="{{this.title}}" class="book-cover" onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/45x60?text=No+Img';">
                      {{else}}
                        <div class="no-image">No Img</div>
                      {{/if}}
                    </td>
                    <td><span class="badge badge-code">{{this.bookId}}</span></td>
                    <td><strong>{{this.title}}</strong></td>
                    <td>{{this.author}}</td>
                    <td>${{this.price}}</td>
                    <td><span class="badge badge-vat">+{{this.vatRate}}%</span></td>
                    <td><strong>${{this.finalPrice}}</strong></td>
                    <td>
                      <button type="button" class="btn-sm btn-edit" onclick="openEditModal('{{this._id}}', '{{this.title}}', '{{this.author}}', '{{this.price}}', '{{this.imageUrl}}')">Sửa</button>
                      <a href="/delete-book/{{this._id}}" class="btn-sm btn-delete" onclick="return confirm('Xác nhận xóa cuốn sách {{this.title}} khỏi CSDL Cloud (readwrite_23IT151)?')">Xóa</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                {{/each}}
              </tbody>
            </table>
          {{else}}
            <p style="text-align: center; color: #6c757d; padding: 20px;">Chưa có dữ liệu sách nào trong database. Vui lòng thêm sách mới ở khung bên phải!</p>
          {{/if}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CỘT BÊN PHẢI: FORM THÊM SÁCH MỚI -->
      <div class="right-column">
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Thêm Sách Mới (Kết nối Write User: readwrite_23IT151)</h2>
          <form action="/add-book" method="POST">
            
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="bookId">Mã Sách (Bắt buộc tiền tố 151):</label>
              <input type="text" id="bookId" name="bookId" placeholder="Ví dụ: 151-BOOK01" required>
              <span class="form-help">* Phải bắt đầu bằng 3 số cuối MSSV: 151</span>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="title">Tên Sách:</label>
              <input type="text" id="title" name="title" placeholder="Tên cuốn sách..." required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="author">Tác Giả:</label>
              <input type="text" id="author" name="author" placeholder="Tên tác giả..." required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="price">Giá Gốc ($):</label>
              <input type="number" id="price" name="price" step="0.01" min="0" placeholder="100" required>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="imageUrl">Link Ảnh Sách (URL):</label>
              <input type="url" id="imageUrl" name="imageUrl" placeholder="https://example.com/image.jpg">
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn">Thêm Sách Vào Cloud Database</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- MODAL CẬP NHẬT SÁCH (READWRITE USER) -->
  <div id="editModal" class="modal-overlay">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">Cập Nhật Thông Tin Sách (readwrite_23IT151)</div>
      <form id="editForm" method="POST">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="editTitle">Tên Sách:</label>
          <input type="text" id="editTitle" name="title" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="editAuthor">Tác Giả:</label>
          <input type="text" id="editAuthor" name="author" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="editPrice">Giá Gốc ($):</label>
          <input type="number" id="editPrice" name="price" step="0.01" min="0" required>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="editImageUrl">Link Ảnh Sách (URL):</label>
          <input type="url" id="editImageUrl" name="imageUrl">
        </div>

        <div class="modal-footer">
          <button type="button" class="btn-sm btn-secondary" onclick="closeEditModal()">Hủy Bỏ</button>
          <button type="submit" class="btn-sm btn-edit" style="padding: 8px 16px;">Lưu Thay Đổi</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <p><strong>Họ và tên: Nguyễn Hoàng Lực | MSSV: 23IT151 | Mức VAT áp dụng: {{vatPercent}}%</strong></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 4px;">Đề thi giữa kỳ môn Điện toán đám mây - Học viện VKU 2026</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    function openEditModal(id, title, author, price, imageUrl) {
      document.getElementById('editForm').action = '/update-book/' + id;
      document.getElementById('editTitle').value = title;
      document.getElementById('editAuthor').value = author;
      document.getElementById('editPrice').value = price;
      document.getElementById('editImageUrl').value = imageUrl || '';
      document.getElementById('editModal').style.display = 'flex';
    }

    function closeEditModal() {
      document.getElementById('editModal').style.display = 'none';
    }

    window.onclick = function(event) {
      var modal = document.getElementById('editModal');
      if (event.target == modal) {
        modal.style.display = 'none';
      }
    }
  </script>

</body>
</html>
